  <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, height: 62, background: '#7C3AED', borderRadius: 10, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>结论：优势是结构性的，不需要文笔——三件套齐了就赢</Text>
